n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]capture_inbox_routing.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/capture_inbox_routing.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-bk[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-bk/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Detect inbox route candidates and refuse without a choice[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]route-detect[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]route-detect: bob capture finds existing inbox tasks whose checkbox the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]batch changes, reports them with route destinations in `inbox_route`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and refuses write-free under hidden `--require-inbox-route-choice`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Apply inbox route answers inside the capture batch[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]route-apply[dim] · [dim][/dim]after route-detect[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]route-apply: `-i/--inbox-route` answers move candidates through the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task-move engine inside the same capture batch, with freshness stamps, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]link repair, refusals, followed mirrors, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decode inbox routes and send route answers in CaptureCore[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-route-client[dim] · [dim][/dim]after route-apply[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-route-client: CaptureCore decodes `inbox_route`, sends answers and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the guard flag behind a per-identity capability, models the route choice[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]state, and documents the protocol.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Route card in the Bob Mac Capture panel[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-route-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-route-client[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-route-card: the panel shows the route card on Return after any [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pull-in card, resubmits the answers, handles refusals, documents the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]card, and lands the memory updates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-bk","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-bk.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-1e63acf37aafc8f325c6d03350105c56","started_at":"2026-10-24T18:14:56.606379+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1792874064,"sha":"4f13e979eb3dba1a69c840bfb2c34a9d0ff7ecd6","subject":"feat(capture): route inbox answers through task-move engine"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"fd6ad323929cb0ed042a878184fb790b7e801209b05027faa00fdae429c49208","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-bk.2/chat.md","size_bytes":4086},"commits":{"digest":"f12005e9775172fdbdebc00c1d4849529a8d8cbf9b95761f825cf9eddf98e110","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-bk.2/commits.json","size_bytes":237},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-bk.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"3fc3b2099bca47fb8deafb05256629d82594b95040a804c826df6ab3f55f18a5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-bk.2/meta.json","size_bytes":703},"prompt":{"digest":"d1cea687ea0c